<title>UK: LIFFE sugar mixed, focused on August expiry.</title>
<headline>LIFFE sugar mixed, focused on August expiry.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>LIFFE sugar was mixed in morning trade, with attention focused on the August contract, which expires on Wednesday, traders said.</p>
<p>&quot;All eyes are on the expiry and that's it today,&quot; one trader said.</p>
<p>By 1015 GMT August was $1.60 higher at $329.00, while October was 70 cents lower at $316.50. October was most active, and it and August dominated volume.</p>
<p>The activity on August was overwhelmingly on switches, the trader said.</p>
<p>--Christopher Lyddon, London newsroom +44 171 542 7928</p>
